WEBVTT

00:10:59.571 --> 00:11:03.117
Who tells the storylines
of women’s sports today?

00:11:04.576 --> 00:11:07.496
Many of you will know the statistic
I'm about to put up.

00:11:07.955 --> 00:11:11.041
University of Southern California,
Purdue University,

00:11:11.083 --> 00:11:12.459
released in 2021,

00:11:12.459 --> 00:11:17.339
studying the year 2019
in sports media coverage.

00:11:19.633 --> 00:11:23.929
Of all of the minutes
of ESPN's SportsCenter in 2019,

00:11:23.929 --> 00:11:27.516
5.1 percent of them
given to women's sports.

00:11:29.226 --> 00:11:32.146
You know what's really sad
about this number?